<%- layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<section class="form-page container" style="padding: 4rem 2rem 5rem 2rem;">
    <div class="form-page__intro">
        <div>
            <span class="eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i> Privacy Policy</span>
            <h1>Your Privacy Matters</h1>
            <p>Learn how StayVista protects and respects your personal information.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-shell" style="padding: 2.5rem;">
        <div class="legal-content">
            <div class="toc-section">
                <h3>Table of Contents</h3>
                <ul class="toc-list">
                    <li><a href="#section1">1. Introduction</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#section2">2. Information We Collect</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#section3">3. How We Use Your Information</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#section4">4. Data Security</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#section5">5. Your Rights</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#section6">6. Cookies & Tracking</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#section7">7. Third-Party Services</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#section8">8. Contact Us</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <section id="section1" class="legal-section">
                <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
                <p>
                    StayVista ("we," "us," "our," or "Company") operates the StayVista website and mobile application. 
                    This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding the collection, use, and protection of your personal information. 
                    We are committed to maintaining your trust by protecting your data.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section2" class="legal-section">
                <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>We collect information in several ways:</p>
                <ul class="conduct-list">
                    <li><strong>Information you provide:</strong> Name, email, phone number, address, payment information, and profile details</li>
                    <li><strong>Booking information:</strong> Dates, preferences, special requests, and cancellation details</li>
                    <li><strong>Communication data:</strong> Messages, reviews, ratings, and support inquiries</li>
                    <li><strong>Automatically collected data:</strong> IP address, device information, browsing activity, and cookies</li>
                    <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> Processed securely through third-party payment providers</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="section3" class="legal-section">
                <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>We use your information for:</p>
                <ul class="conduct-list">
                    <li>Processing and fulfilling bookings and transactions</li>
                    <li>Sending confirmation, payment, and service-related emails</li>
                    <li>Personalizing your experience and improving our services</li>
                    <li>Responding to inquiries and providing customer support</li>
                    <li>Preventing fraud and enhancing security</li>
                    <li>Marketing communications (with your consent)</li>
                    <li>Analytics and understanding user behavior</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="section4" class="legal-section">
                <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
                <p>
                    We implement industry-standard security measures including SSL encryption, secure payment gateways, 
                    and restricted access to personal data. However, no method of transmission is 100% secure. 
                    We cannot guarantee absolute security but work diligently to protect your information.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section5" class="legal-section">
                <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>You have the right to:</p>
                <ul class="conduct-list">
                    <li>Access, review, and download your personal data</li>
                    <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
                    <li>Request deletion of your account and associated data</li>
                    <li>Opt-out of marketing communications</li>
                    <li>Withdraw consent for data processing</li>
                    <li>Lodge a complaint with relevant authorities</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="section6" class="legal-section">
                <h2>6. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
                <p>
                    StayVista uses cookies to enhance user experience, remember preferences, and analyze site usage. 
                    You can manage cookie preferences in your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect site functionality.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section7" class="legal-section">
                <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
                <p>
                    We use third-party services for payment processing, analytics, and hosting. These services have their own 
                    privacy policies. We are not responsible for their practices, but we ensure they meet our security standards.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section id="section8" class="legal-section">
                <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have privacy concerns or wish to exercise your rights, please contact us:
                </p>
                <div class="contact-info">
                    <p><strong>Email:</strong> privacy@stayvista.com</p>
                    <p><strong>Address:</strong> StayVista Inc., Global Headquarters</p>
                    <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> We respond within 7 business days</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <div class="legal-footer">
                <p>
                    <em>Last Updated: May 2026</em>
                </p>
                <p>
                    We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Significant changes will be notified via email 
                    or a prominent notice on our website.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .legal-content {
        max-width: 900px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .toc-section {
        background: rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.12);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .toc-section h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .toc-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .toc-list li {
        padding: 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .toc-list a {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .toc-list a:hover {
        color: var(--accent-strong);
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .legal-section {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .legal-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
        color: var(--text);
        padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.2);
    }

    .legal-section p {
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .conduct-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .conduct-list li {
        padding: 0.6rem 0 0.6rem 2rem;
        position: relative;
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .conduct-list li:before {
        content: "•";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .contact-info {
        background: rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.04);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .contact-info p {
        margin: 0.5rem 0;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .legal-footer {
        margin-top: 3rem;
        padding-top: 2rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .legal-content {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .toc-section {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .legal-section h2 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .contact-info {
            padding: 1rem;
        }
    }
</style>
